          "n": "2",
          "text": "As soon as I get out of bed, I exercise, sometimes hiking a nearby trail, sometimes jogging, and sometimes playing an early round of golf.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "As soon as I get out of bed,",
              "ko": "잠자리에서 일어나자마자,"
